      "text": "This is Mrs. Redding. Fine, thank you, yes."
    },
    {
      "start": 1705.13,
      "end": 1715.1,
      "text": "This next one is the cross between Mazzavani and Weather Report."
    },
    {
      "start": 1715.1,
      "end": 1720.62,
      "text": "This one's from Spoken Morning's album."
    },
    {
      "start": 1720.62,
      "end": 2149.89,
      "text": "This is called Every Day."
    },
    {
      "start": 2149.89,
      "end": 2152.71,
      "text": "Every Day."
    },
    {
      "start": 2152.71,
      "end": 2156.45,
      "text": "And now we're going to try something from an older album."
    },
    {
      "start": 2156.45,
      "end": 2162.16,
      "text": "This one's from Voyage of the Acolyte."
    },
    {
      "start": 2162.16,
      "end": 2580.5,
      "text": "It was called by myself and Nick Magnus, the keyboard player up here."
    },
    {
      "start": 2580.5,
      "end": 2589.23,
      "text": "This one was written in sunny downtown Dulles Hill, just a little away from Neasden."
    },
    {
      "start": 2589.23,
      "end": 2594.52,
      "text": "And this one, something you cured, it's called Funny Feeling."
    },
    {
      "start": 2594.52,
      "end": 4126.22,
      "text": "Tower struck down."
    },
    {
      "start": 4126.22,
